cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software-code
title: "canopy biomass"
doi: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23992410
abstract: >-
  Calculate above ground biomass and foliar weights for trees and shrubs of the southwestern
  United States from standard forestry measurements. Provides units aware calculations of total
  and foliar biomass for trees and large shrubs from measurements such as height, diameter at
  breast height, and diameter at root collar, as well as the best estimate of Available
  Canopy Fuel when available.
authors:
